# Lucy invariants

- Plane boundary: audio frames never enter Python; media plane owns the socket; control channel is events/directives only.
- Open-core: SDK (`src/lucy/`) never imports platform/Pili; voice Protocols/spec models are frozen public ABI.
- Telemetry: PII redaction, audio suppression, sampling client-side before leave-process (`docs/telemetry-wire-v1.md`).
- Typed config: no inline provider/model/URL/threshold/budget hardcoding.
- No-mocks plane (ADR 0003): no mocking frameworks inventing provider behavior.
